      <div class="article-container aalto-article__top">

                  <div class="aalto-article__hub-text">

                    <a href="/en/admissions" hreflang="en">Admission Services</a>
            </div>
        
                <h1>
  Scholarships and Tuition Fees</h1>
                                          <div class="aalto-article__ingress">
            
                    Students from outside the EU, EEA or Switzerland studying in a bachelor’s or master’s programme taught in English are liable to pay tuition fees. <br />
<br />
Aalto University offers a limited number of scholarships in the form of tuition fee waivers to fee-paying students. The scholarships are highly competitive and granted to the top applicants.  
            
          </div>
        
      </div>
    </div>

          <div class="aalto-article__hero-wrap full-bleed-container full-bleed-container--hero">
        <div class="aalto-article__hero-container aalto-article__hero-container--default">
                    

  
<figure role="figure" aria-label="Aalto University students, photo by Unto Rautio">
  <div class="">
    <div class="media-with-caption__container">
      
                    


  
      
                        <picture>
                  <source srcset="/sites/default/files/styles/2_3_1040w_452h_n/public/2023-10/Aaltoyliopisto_230916_photo_Aino_Huovio-2472.jpg?h=5789c45b&amp;itok=GKhASwjn 1040w, /sites/default/files/styles/2_3_1380w_600h_n/public/2023-10/Aaltoyliopisto_230916_photo_Aino_Huovio-2472.jpg?h=5789c45b&amp;itok=Z4zeupua 1380w" media="all and (min-width: 992px)" type="image/jpeg" sizes="(min-width: 1540px) 1380px, (min-width: 992px) calc(100vw - 160px), calc(100vw - 160px)" width="1380" height="600"/>
